 & ={lim}_{a\\to {0}^{+}}{\\int }_{a}^{4}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{{u}^{5}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to {0}^{+}}{\\int }_{a}^{4}{u}^{-5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={lim}_{a\\to {0}^{+}}{(-\\frac{1}{4}\\,{u}^{-4})|}_{a}^{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to {0}^{+}}{\\frac{1}{{u}^{4}}|}_{a}^{4} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to {0}^{+}}[\\frac{1}{256}-\\frac{1}{{a}^{4}}] \\\\  & =\\infty \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that the integral is divergent." 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328823 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328824 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328825 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328826 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1000 #edb/ref 17592186328827 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1041 "selection" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1104 #edb/ref 17592186328823 13194139535056 true] [17592186328822 1110 #uuid "5e2cd14d-b1e9-5fa5-9bc6-9332fff67489" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328823 1034 "The integral is divergent" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328823 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535056 true] [17592186328823 1111 #uuid "5df580a9-0eaa-5ae1-82df-bdaf3844274d" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328824 1034 "\\frac{2}{5}" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328824 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535056 true] [17592186328824 1111 #uuid "a2333b34-e8b2-5506-ac82-caedc47e5776" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328825 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328825 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535056 true] [17592186328825 1111 #uuid "022ddb0f-863d-56b7-b9b2-ae84f2558c65" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328826 1034 "\\frac{3}{4}" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328826 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535056 true] [17592186328826 1111 #uuid "8ffd87f0-df5a-5032-bbb5-b4b9f2b5e83a" 13194139535056 true] [17592186328827 1034 "\\frac{3}{8}" 13194139535056 true] 